{"type":"message","id":"d924ef35","parentId":"b41cbf3c","timestamp":"2026-05-22T08:36:24.281Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Fri 2026-05-22 08:36 UTC] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: REPAIR REQUIRED — Your article body exceeds 1200 words. Compress toward 1100 words. Tighten sentences; do not cut required sections.\n\nRe-read /tmp/crypto-run-20260522-083045/research/validated.json and COINOGRAPHY_TEMPLATE.md before writing.\n\nFull contract (all rules apply — do not skip any):\n- H1: SEO title using primary_keyword from validated.json; topic must clearly match research.\n- Structure: within borders — H2 body sections 2-4, H3 subsections 3-6, FAQ items 3-6; ## Conclusion then ## FAQs last before Sources.\n- Links: exactly 2 distinct source anchors in hook/first H2 only (URLs from source_urls in validated.json).\n- Footer: **Sources:** with URL bullets; final line [Word Count: NNNN] (body words only, footers not counted).\n- Length: 1000–1200 body words (aim 1100).\n- META: SEO Title ≤55 chars, URL Slug ≤70 chars, Meta Description ≤155 chars (count before writing).\n- Write the full article to /tmp/crypto-run-20260522-083045/article/raw.md. Yield SUCCESS only."}],"timestamp":1779438984271}}
